락 상태\n\n---\n\n### 💡 4. 가장 깔끔한 즉시 조치 방안\n\n현재 파일(`배현명.xlsx`)은 바탕화면에 보관 중인 **`최종본_수정완료.xlsx`**(주소 100% 완비 + 3,026개 주황색 셀 반영본) 대비 이전 버전의 데이터가 덮어씌워진 상태입니다.\n\n따라서 다음과 같이 한 번에 최종 정리하시는 것을 추천합니다:\n1. 이미 완성되어 있는 **`최종본_수정완료.xlsx`**를 베이스로 삼고,\n2. 오늘 새로 발굴하신 **12288행 `(주)모노플로우` 법인번호(`110111-8382593`)**를 삽입한 후,\n3. 개인사업자에 잘못 들어간 법인번호(총 7건: 1차 5건 + 2차 2건)를 공란 처리하여 **`(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx`로 최종 덮어쓰기 저장**\n\n원하시면 시스템 자원 소모 없이 빠르고 안전하게 위 병합 및 정제 작업을 즉시 실행해 드릴 수 있습니다. 진행할까요?","thinking":"**Preventing further resource consumption**\n\nAcknowledging the user's warning about resource consumption, especially regarding background tasks and memory, the focus must be on preventing heavy in-memory operations. The audit is complete, and relevant data is already gathered, row numbers and quantities are known. The goal is now to avoid any redundant multi-file loading.\n\n\n**Prioritizing data validation efficiency**\n\nThe immediate goal is to perform a targeted comparison of only the problematic 2nd data segment (rows 11,847-12,346) within the specified file. Data discrepancies in this range indicate the highest priority. The analysis requires a verification to detect if the most recent updates are present, or have reverted.\n\n\n**Identifying data integrity issues**\n\nInitial assessment highlights several data integrity issues: loss of cell formatting (3,026 cells reverted to default), address/zip code omissions (81 and 15 instances respectively), and missing NICE industry codes (27 cases). Row 12,288 shows the most recent update of the corporate registration number. Data from rows 702 to 5,500 includes 5 instances of incorrectly recorded corporate numbers for individual businesses.\n\n\n**Validating business registration numbers**\n\nThe current focus is to validate business registration numbers. First, removing the corporate registration number from individual businesses as these are not registered corporations. Further assessment involves checking the modulo 11 check di